                        "content": "To persuade stubborn people, Aristotle proved you need 3 distinct pillars:\n1. ETHOS: Appeal to authority, reputation, and trust.\n2. PATHOS: Appeal to emotion, care, and human story.\n3. LOGOS: Appeal to logic, facts, and hard evidence.",
