                        "content": "Agatha Spindle whispers to you: 'Captain Bluster respects authority (Ethos). Gerald Nibbs fears public outrage (Pathos). I have sea level measurements (Logos). If you combine all three pillars into one appeal, they cannot refuse!'",
                        "align": "left"
                    },
                    "state": "active",
                    "status": "uncompleted"
                },
